# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Secrets must never be committed (GoLive uses Windows Credential Manager,
# not .env files, for the OpenAI API key — this is a defensive guard only)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# The real GoLive database lives in the OS per-user app-data directory,
# never in the repo — this is a defensive guard against accidentally
# committing a local SQLite file (e.g. from ad-hoc debugging). Migration
# *.sql files under src-tauri/migrations/ are unaffected and stay tracked.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
